Given below are two statements :
<table border="1" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1" style="width:500px;"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Statement I:</strong></td><td>In gymnosperms, the male and female gametophytes remain within the sporangia.</td></tr><tr><td><strong><span style="white-space:nowrap;">Statement II:</span></strong></td><td>In gymnosperms, seeds are not covered.</td></tr></tbody></table>In the light of the above statements, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below :<br>&nbsp;
<table border="1" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1" style="min-width: 300px;"><tbody><tr><td>1.</td><td><strong>Statement I</strong> is incorrect but <strong>Statement II </strong>is correct</td></tr><tr><td>2.</td><td>Both <strong>Statement I </strong>and <strong>Statement II </strong>are correct</td></tr><tr><td>3.</td><td>Both <strong>Statement I </strong>and <strong>Statement II </strong>are incorrect</td></tr><tr><td>4.</td><td><strong>Statement I </strong>is correct but <strong>Statement II </strong>is incorrect</td></tr></tbody></table>
